{
  "experiment_id": "A10_no_ordinal_margin",
  "description": "同时关闭序数保序惩罚与class-1间隔约束，检验毁伤等级有序结构约束的贡献。",
  "paths": {
    "data": "output/damage_dataset.parquet",
